    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσό-τῠπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shaped alike</i>, <i><span class="en">
